        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;In the HCMM&lt;/b&gt; (Cyron et al. 2016) every constituent \(j\) has its own elastic part:&lt;br&gt;\(\mathbf F_e^j = \mathbf F\,\mathbf F_g^{-1}\,(\mathbf F_r^j)^{-1}\), with \(\mathbf F_g\) shared by the mixture and \(\mathbf F_r^j\) the remodeling of constituent \(j\).&lt;br&gt;The residual stress is not obtained by assembling grown pieces: constituents are deposited prestretched by \(\mathbf G^j\)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
